-- title:
--   Admissible small constants over a valuation ring above q=3
-- statement:
--   Let $q$ be a prime with $q = 3$, let $M'$ be a nonzero natural number with $q \nmid M'$, and let $A$ be a valuation subring of $\overline{\mathbb{Q}} = \mathrm{AlgebraicClosure}\,\mathbb{Q}$ which lies over $q$ in the sense that the image of $q$ in $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ belongs to `A.nonunits`, i.e. lies in the maximal ideal of $A$. Then there are an intermediate field $k_0$ of $\mathbb{Q} \subseteq \overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ and an element $\pi_0 \in k_0$ whose image lies in $A$ such that, writing $A_0 := A \cap k_0$ for the pullback of $A$ along $k_0 \to \overline{\mathbb{Q}}$: $A_0$ is a discrete valuation ring whose maximal ideal is generated by $\pi_0$; $A_0$ is a henselian local ring; the residue field of $A_0$ is algebraically closed; and every $a \in A$ admits $c \in k_0$ with $c \in A$ and $a - c$ in the maximal ideal of $A$. Moreover there are a prime $\ell$ with $\ell \ge 3$, $\ell \ne q$ and $\ell \nmid M'$, an element $\zeta_0 \in k_0$ whose image in $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ is a primitive $q\ell$-th root of unity, and an element $\varpi_t \in k_0$ whose image lies in $A$ together with a unit $u$ of $A$ satisfying $\varpi_t^{\,q^2-1} = q\,u$ in $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$.
--
--   This provides the package of "small constants" — a henselian discrete valuation subfield $k_0 \subseteq \overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ with algebraically closed residue field and residue-surjective onto that of $A$, an auxiliary prime $\ell$ coprime to $qM'$, a primitive $q\ell$-th root of unity and a $(q^2-1)$-st root of $q$ up to a unit, all living in $k_0$ — used in the supersingular local analysis at $q = 3$. It is the $q = 3$ case of the corresponding statement for $q \ge 5$, and is invoked by [`ModularCurve.FullLevel.exists_supersingularRegularProlongation_smoothPointCharts_of_eq_three_of_dvd`](thm.html#ModularCurve.FullLevel.exists_supersingularRegularProlongation_smoothPointCharts_of_eq_three_of_dvd).
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ValuationSubring_exists_admissible_smallConstants_of_eq_three.lean

